_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-02T00:13:57Z","updated_at":"2022-10-02T00:13:57Z","body":"Fedora priority: Low.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1264513445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1264529874","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1264529874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655","id":1264529874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85LXzHS","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-10-02T02:17:48Z","updated_at":"2022-10-02T02:17:48Z","body":"I'd suggest calling this the `BSD-43TAHOE` license. Looking at the TUHS archive, it is used starting in 4.3BSD-Tahoe and continues to be used in Net1 and 4.3BSD-Reno. There's a couple of variations depending on which distribution you look at that differ only in line breaks and copyright year though. It has the disclaimer that the proposed BSD-43RENO text lacks. 4.3BSD-Tahoe was chronologically first of these releases. By the time that 4.4BSD-Alpha came along, it was no longer in use (again, as far as I could tell, I didn't chase down every file where some of the above text appeared to confirm that text has been incorporated into the Net2 or BSD-4-Clause license. Neither of these licenses is used in 4.3BSD or 4.2BSD releases, as those used the old 'subject to agreement' wording. It also appears in 2.11BSD on a few files, but those are clearly derived from one of the post 4.3BSD releases typically related to networking.\r\n\r\nI believe there's at least one more archaic BSD license lurking still. I found it before, but have lost my notes on it it seems (though I suppose it's possible it was just the line break differences that I didn't realize were the same).\r\n\r\nOtherwise, I think this meets all the points for inclusion: It's an open source license, that's widely used, that has a more or less fixed text, though it is of mostly historical interest now as newer projects don't seem to be using it, but there's not really a license steward, per se, since Berkeley moved on from using it after 1990 or so.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1264529874/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1363380501","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1363380501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655","id":1363380501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RQ4kV","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-22T21:49:10Z","updated_at":"2022-12-22T21:49:10Z","body":"+1 to add, for same reasons as documented for the proposed BSD-4.3RENO in #1635.\r\n\r\nI note that this one appears to have \"BSD-43TAHOE\" as the identifier, without a period between 4 and 3 (unlike 4.3RENO in #1635). I don't have a preference which is more correct, just assume they should match either way  :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1363380501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364298081","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1364298081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655","id":1364298081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RUYlh","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-23T20:07:00Z","updated_at":"2022-12-23T20:07:00Z","body":"I'll +1 so this can move forward but all these random variants (56.8% match on BSD-4-Shortened) still make me grumpy.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364298081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364346498","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1364346498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655","id":1364346498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RUkaC","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-23T21:30:43Z","updated_at":"2022-12-23T21:30:43Z","body":"> I'll +1 so this can move forward but all these random variants (56.8% match on BSD-4-Shortened) still make me grumpy.\r\n\r\nThe BSD license evolved between 4.3, 4.3-Tahoe and 4.3-Reno before it became the BSD-4-Clause license in 4.4BSD.\r\n\r\nIf you want to get grumpy, look at the FreeBSD, NetBSD or OpenBSD tree. There's likely 40-60 variations between those three trees (maybe 30-45 in each tree), especially for the older architectures and drivers. Clauses that require things to be first, talking about the voices in Bill Paul's head, stupid grammar changes that likely can be merged with the current SPDX tags, but still need review.\r\n\r\nBut then again, I get grumpy that OSI approved a not what was published license as the BSD license w/o consulting the BSD community... and they haven't been all that proactive about the nuanced variations in the BSD license world, nor have they tried to raise awareness to the problem 20-ish years ago when something could have been done to get permission to change licenses back when more authors were in touch and (sadly in some cases) alive...","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364346498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364535900","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1364535900","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655","id":1364535900,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RVSpc","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-24T14:10:54Z","updated_at":"2022-12-24T14:10:54Z","body":"@bsdimp to @swinslow's question, I assume \"BSD-4.3TAHOE\" would be more justifiable as an identifier than \"BSD-43TAHOE\", do you agree?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364535900/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1364615051","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1655#issuecomment-1364615051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repo